# L2 -> L1 frontend. Root statements belong to the unit's method row E. The builder
# retains supported operator bodies and installs available native entries on their
# actual callable occurrences. Calls dispatch through that occurrence's native word,
# or walk its retained body when the word is absent. Typed body symbols are private
# adapter implementation details. The host reserves R0, builds the unit in its arena,
# and launches it through lmx_root_launch; exit handling belongs to the host.

