        i: i + 1
    ---
    if: k > 0 && fputs("end: prototype\n", l2_out) < 0
        fclose(l2_out)
        return: 1
    if: fputs("\n# Backend method symbols are l2_m{i}; intern and find_method keep source names. c.malloc stays the foreign door.\n# Publication: write tmp; if dest.bak exists pick dest.bak.N; rename dest to that bak; rename tmp to dest; on fail restore bak or report its path. Not atomic. No recursive FS. Foreign bak is not deleted.\n# A method's own field used by a bare name has a working value l2_qN, loaded at entry from its cell in the selected occurrence `self` (slot handle l2_qN_from); a write changes l2_qN and sets l2_qN_dirty; a call, a c.* call, a copying receiver, sendMessage and every exit first publish the marked fields in field order and unmark them; a clean one is not written back and nothing is reloaded after a call (book section 12, 14; Lingvamyxa spec 21.5, 21.6). An explicit path and @x of an own field are its cell. Source-visible `node` is the fixed lexical space above the method for the whole activation; explicit node\\name reads and writes that graph. Every mutable numeric field, including char, has a distinct owned cell of its declared C type (no interned shared size_t, no int narrowing).\n# Lmx structural access stays child-index. Foreign C is spelled c.name and emitted as written; the C compiler checks it. A bare name is an L2 value; a callable is invoked only by an explicit call Frame. Body reference declarations designate real typed pointer-value cells. Pointer results pass their stored reference; sub: is void. Native @ of a Structure or nonprimitive formal forwards its descriptor; @ of an explicit pointer binding addresses its typed pointer-value cell. Primitive formals address their local parameter cells, not graph fields. Nonprimitive signature descriptions never address the hidden machine parameter transporting the descriptor. A declaration of a formal's name without an initializer takes the argument into its cell. Executable if/else/while/for bodies are graph Structures; their own fields are cells of their exact host. &&/|| use guarded evaluation through the common expression path; skipped RHS neither prepares actuals nor reads fields or Array elements.\n\n", l2_out) < 0
